OL,3,GNEWSA#2.5bn data centre refused        
OL,4,Aplanning permission                    
OL,6,FCouncillors have voted to refuse       
OL,7,Fplanning permission for a #2.5bn data  
OL,8,Fcentre next to a travellers site.      
OL,10,FArk Data Centres had applied to build a
OL,11,Fset of four-storey data centres on the 
OL,12,Fsite of the former Mercure Hotel in    
OL,13,FBushey, Hertfordshire.                 
OL,15,FAlthough Hertsmere Borough Council     
OL,16,Fplanning officers recommended          
OL,17,Fpermission be granted, eight           
OL,18,Fcouncillors voted against the scheme,  
OL,19,Fwhile five voted in favour at a meeting
OL,20,Fon Thursday.                           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
