OL,3,GNEWSA#2.5bn data centre refused        
OL,4,Aplanning permission                    
OL,6,FThe chair repeatedly appealed to       
OL,7,Fmembers of the public to stop heckling,
OL,8,Fand the meeting was adjourned for      
OL,9,Falmost 40 minutes.                     
